          "name": "Gift of Foresight",
          "type": "ACTIVE",
          "text": "Whenever a friendly Arnor model within 6\" and Line of Sight of Malbeth suffers a Wound, roll a D6. On a 5+ the Wound is prevented and ignored. A Hero may still use Fate Points if this roll fails."
        },
        {
          "name": "Foresight of the Eldar",
          "type": "ACTIVE",
          "text": "At the start of the game, roll a D6 to set Malbeth's store of Foresight Points. During the Priority roll, so long as he is alive, he may spend these points to add 1 each to his side's Priority roll, up to a maximum of 6."
        }
      ]
